	(text "ARCHITECTURE.md 3.1-3.2. The doc calls this connector J1 (its name on the IO board); on the CPU board it is J9.\nBoth buffers are disabled at power-up (BUS_OE_N pulled high) and NBRESET is held low until firmware releases it.\nSeries resistors on the J9 side for the ribbon cable. Unused 74AHCT541 inputs tied low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d00a0d84-d97b-5aaa-acb8-bcad0ad4e228")
	)
